{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17106","headline":"奉陪武相公西亭夜宴陆郎中 · 独孤实","name":"奉陪武相公西亭夜宴陆郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙郎膺上才，夜宴接三台。\n烛引银河转，花连锦帐开。\n静看歌扇举，不觉舞腰回。\n寥落东方曙，无辞尽玉杯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤实","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17106.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17106","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}